					<p class="mt-4 max-w-xl text-sm leading-6 text-white/60">I help founders and lean teams turn ambiguous software goals into shipped systems, practical architecture, and maintainable code.</p>
					<a href={ routes.ProjectInquiryIndex.URL() } class="mt-8 inline-flex bg-white px-4 py-2 text-xs font-bold text-zinc-950 transition-colors hover:bg-zinc-200">Start an inquiry</a>
