						<p class="mt-2 max-w-xs leading-5">Senior engineering judgment, hands-on implementation, and clear delivery tradeoffs.</p>
					</div>
					<div>
						<p class="font-bold text-white">Built for focused teams</p>
						<p class="mt-2 max-w-xs leading-5">MVPs, internal tools, automation, developer infrastructure, and codebase modernization.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="grid gap-10 py-16 md:grid-cols-[1fr_1fr_1fr_1fr_1.4fr]">
